		{
			dependencies: ["43E048AFA6F466E1"]
			description: [
				"Oil distillation will take place on the largest processing machinery available to us, the &6distillation columns&r, and there shall be &63&r of them."
				""
				"All of them share the same assembling rules: firstly a &6steel tank&r of size 2x2 or larger must be placed, then under it, one &6distillation controller&r, and lastly, one and only one &6output&r per &llayer&r."
				""
				"Each type has unique requirements:"
				""
				"&6Flash&r > 500mb of steam per recipe"
				""
				"&6Atmospheric&r > size 3x3 and constant heat"
				""
				"&6Vacuum&r > constant depletion of air and heat"
				""
				"Additionally, redstone activated outputs will enable a discard mode, it is recommended only for testing, as you will need &lall&r of them."
			]
